/* 零工 NPC 关系线 / 5 人 × 3 段 / 与零工等级挂钩 / 小回报与关系增量 */

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
格威岚把一张破网摊在栈桥木板上，网脚被礁石割开一道整齐的口子。格威岚用梭子挑起断线，朝你抬了抬下巴。
「不是鱼咬的，」格威岚说，「是刀。昨晚有人从外礁过来，顺手割了我的网。」
<br><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[蹲下帮格威岚补网 (0:08)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 8>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<money 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问格威岚昨晚看见了谁 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 5>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[替格威岚买一卷新网线 (0:06)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>><<money -200>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanNet to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回码头 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
夜潮退到外礁，格威岚提着一盏蒙布的风灯站在礁脊上。格威岚指向两块黑礁之间的水面：「我的网昨晚就是在那儿被割的。水底下有东西，不像鱼。」
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanNet is 1>>
	你带来的新网线缠在格威岚手腕上，灯一照，线头泛着干净的白色。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<swimicon>><<link [[潜到黑礁之间查看 (0:08)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<money 300>><<stress -2>><<else>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[沿岸礁找割网的刀痕 (0:07)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[劝格威岚先收网回去 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回码头 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 3>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanClue is 1>>
	黑礁之间卡着一只没有标记的防水袋。袋口缠着割断的网线，里面是几卷用油纸包好的私货和一截断刀。格威岚看了一眼，没有伸手。
	「这东西不能留在我的网里，」格威岚说，「你打算怎么办？」
<<else>>
	你们在礁石上找到半截断刀和几段被割断的网线。格威岚把刀踢进水里，脸色不太好看。
	「今晚先收网，」格威岚说，「明天再来看。」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把私货交给格威岚处理 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 5>><<money 400>><<stress -3>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 2>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[自己留下防水袋 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 5>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanKeep to 1>><<money 700>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[只抄下袋上的编号 (0:04)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 4>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<money 150>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回码头 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
第二天下午，格威岚在鱼档后面给你留了一只小木箱。箱里是晒好的鱼干、一卷新网线和一小袋盐。
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanKeep is 1>>
	格威岚没有提防水袋的事，只在你转身时说了句：「昨晚的风向不对。以后别一个人去外礁。」
<<else>>
	格威岚把木箱推到你手边：「下次潮退，你还来帮我看网吗？」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[收下木箱并答应下次再来 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<pass 3>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回码头 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
塞拉把一只没有主人的银壳怀表推到你面前，表盖上刻着一个很小的「M」。
「送修的人三周没来取，」她说，「押金只够付零件。你替我看看，里面有没有名字。」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拆开后盖看刻字 (0:06)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<money 300>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问塞拉送修人的样子 (0:04)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问塞拉送修人的样子 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[按押金价把表买下 (0:04)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<money -400>><<set $mpJoblineSeraBought to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
表盖内侧刻着一行很小的字：『给玛拉，等雾散。』下面还有一枚被磨平的地址，只剩下「旧钟塔」三个字。塞拉把放大镜放下，手指在柜台上轻轻敲了两下。
「玛拉，」她说，「这个名字我见过。不是这十年的事。」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去翻旧钟塔的维修簿 (0:07)|MP Jobline Sera 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 3>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<pass 7>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260>><<money 250>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[请塞拉讲玛拉的事 (0:06)|MP Jobline Sera 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 3>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请塞拉讲玛拉的事 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineSera to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
维修簿上记着二十年前的一只怀表，送修人签名是「M. W.」，取表日期那一栏空着。塞拉把簿子合上，沉默了一会儿。
「表你留着吧，」她说，「押金我退你。要是哪天有人来问，就说没见过。」
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把表留在柜台 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 4>><<pass 4>><<money 500>><<stress -3>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 1>><</if>><</link>>
