<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
亚历克斯在谷仓梁上摸出一只铁皮盒，盒里是一叠发黄的佃租收据。最上面那张的租额被红笔改过三次，最后一次的签名不是亚历克斯。
「这块地以前不是我的，」亚历克斯说，「我买下来的时候，上一任说收据都烧了。」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[按日期排收据 (0:07)|MP Jobline Alex 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to Math.max(($mpJoblineAlex or 0), 2)>><<pass 7>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<money 250>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
