:: MP Jobline Alex 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to Math.max(($mpJoblineAlex or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
收据背面记着一笔从未缴清的「水渠份子钱」。亚历克斯把纸翻过来，指着最下面一行：「这条水渠早就不从我家地里过了，可账上还在收。」亚历克斯把铁锹往地上一插：「今晚要下雨。你要是有空，帮我把西边那条旧渠挖开，看看水到底往哪儿走。」
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[冒雨挖开旧渠 (0:09)|MP Jobline Alex 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 3>><<pass 9>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<money 350>><<stress 2>><<else>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[先看渠口的石标 (0:06)|MP Jobline Alex 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 3>><<pass 6>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回谷仓 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
旧渠底下埋着一截被石头压住的木管，管口通向邻地。亚历克斯蹲下去看了很久，把铁锹横在膝上。
「水是从他们地里接过来的，」亚历克斯说，「怪不得这些年我的井一直不够用。」
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[劝 亚历克斯 找佃租官说理 (0:05)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 5>><<money 300>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 2>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">劝 亚历克斯 找佃租官说理 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[把木管重新埋好 (0:05)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 5>><<set $mpJoblineAlexQuiet to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[当场截断木管 (0:06)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 6>><<set $mpJoblineAlexCut to 1>><<money 450>><<stress 3>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回田埂 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
雨停后，亚历克斯把第一捆新麦放在你脚边，麦芒上还挂着水珠。
<<if $mpJoblineAlexCut is 1>>
	「明年这条渠归我，」亚历克斯说，「你要是还想来帮忙，我给你留一块地。」
<<elseif $mpJoblineAlexQuiet is 1>>
	「先不闹大，」亚历克斯说，「但账我记着。你今晚帮了我大忙。」
<<else>>
	「官面上的人明天来，」亚历克斯说，「你一起来吧。有些话你说比我管用。」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[收下麦捆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<pass 3>><<money 200>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回田埂 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Jordan 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Spa")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Spa">><</if>>
池边的石凳上落着一张被蒸汽浸软的祷词卡。乔丹捡起来，看了一眼就递给你。
「不是我们神殿的格式，」乔丹说，「但字是真的。你认得出来吗？」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[读祷词卡上的字 (0:05)|MP Jobline Jordan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to Math.max(($mpJoblineJordan or 0), 2)>><<pass 5>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineJordanClue to 1>><<money 250>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[问乔丹这张卡是谁的 (0:04)|MP Jobline Jordan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to Math.max(($mpJoblineJordan or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineJordanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问乔丹这张卡是谁的 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回池边 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Jordan 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineJordan to Math.max(($mpJoblineJordan or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Spa")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Spa">><</if>>
祷词卡的背面用铅笔写着七个名字，最后一个被水泡得只剩半个。乔丹把卡翻过来，指腹在第一个名字上停了停。
「这个人我认识，」乔丹说，「上个月来过。他说他在等一个人，等到雾散就走。」
<br><br>
